unty runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025, April to May hit 163% of normal and November to December fell to 49%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 37% and February to March at 41%. Every grid had its driest year in 2010, with grid 15756 at 57%.</p>"}
